  "//version": "Intentionally no version field. This is a private workspace manifest, not a shippable product. Each app owns its own version and the release workflows read those directly (e.g. release-desktop.yml reads apps/desktop/package.json). A root version drifted to 1.1.7 while desktop/mobile/extension shipped 1.2.0, which read as a product version and was wrong everywhere. Founder decision 2026-08-04.",
